graph TD
    S[Start] --> O[Original: log_a(b^x * c) = log_a(d)]
    O --> P[Apply product rule: log_a(b^x) + log_a(c) = log_a(d)]
    P --> Q[Apply power rule: x·log_a(b) + log_a(c) = log_a(d)]
    Q --> R[Isolate x‑term: x·log_a(b) = log_a(d) - log_a(c)]
    R --> T[Combine RHS using quotient rule: x·log_a(b) = log_a(d/c)]
    T --> U[Solve for x: x = log_a(d/c) / log_a(b)]
    U --> V[Optional: change‑of‑base: x = log(d/c) / log(b)]
    V --> E[End]
    classDef startEnd fill:#f9f,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px;
    class S,E startEnd;